<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AmeriCredit said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AmeriCredit said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of AmeriCredit Corp with an attractive rating, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 19-3/8.</p>
</text>
